  "details": "Easy Anti-Cheat Causes System Crashes\n\nApex Legends, which also uses Easy Anti-Cheat, is experiencing the same issue.\n\nAccording to reports in the Apex Legends Bug Reports, this issue may only occur on systems using AMD processors.\n\nI have tried the following troubleshooting steps:\n\nInstalled the latest graphics card drivers, as well as several previous driver versions, but the issue persists.\n\nUpdated Windows to the latest version, but this did not resolve the issue.\n\nPerformed a clean installation of Windows 10 and Windows 11, with only the necessary drivers and the game installed. The issue still occurs.\n\nDisabled Windows Core Isolation, but this did not resolve the issue.\n\nBased on these observations, I suspect there may be a compatibility issue between Easy Anti-Cheat and AMD processors.",
